{"title":"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Call the figure below a \"<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-tableau\" shape. Determine the number of rectangles of all sizes contained within this shape.\nNote that a square is considered a rectangle, and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/4/4c4f94c264467f57f0c7de87e09dd5ee97ee61ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> rectangle is considered different from a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99d4e9450e6f37da3ac6d5cacec40ae09d40130a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />.\nExpress your answer as a binomial coefficient and explain the significance of your expression. Generalize, with proof, to an \"<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />-tableau\" shape.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/40701260398d42e58abedffd16b69fb89e5e4c30.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] for(int j=0;j&lt;5;++j){ draw((0,j)--(min(j+1,4),j),black); draw((j,max(0,j-1))--(j,4),black);  } filldraw((2,2)--(2,3)--(1,3)--(1,2)--cycle,blue); filldraw((2,2)--(3,2)--(3,3)--(2,3)--cycle,blue); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd44c7ef27cff181b24d365851ec7a8335a313a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{7}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"33\" height=\"53\" /> in general <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81fe3dafe7dd5b400a23f81325bf42bac0da0ce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{n+3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"66\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II\">2006 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10